{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-09-01 19:00:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF BERKSHIRE INSURANCE GROUP, INC.', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., SEPT. 01, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF THE ASSETS AND OPERATIONS OF BERKSHIRE INSURANCE GROUP, INC. BY BROWN & BROWN OF MASSACHUSETTS, LLC, A SUBSIDIARY OF BROWN & BROWN.'}